#. i18n: file: setupserverview.ui:22
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, label)
#: rc.cpp:18
#| msgid ""
#| "Indicate the IMAP server. If you want to connect to a non-standard port "
#| "for a specific encryption scheme, you can add \":port\" to indicate that. "
#| "For example: \"imap.bla.nl:144\"."
msgid ""
"Indicate the IMAP server. If you want to connect to a non-standard port for "
"a specific encryption scheme, you can add \":port\" to indicate that. For "
"example: \"imap.foo.com:144\"."
msgstr ""
"Indicar o servidor de IMAP. Se se quere ligar cun porto non normal para un "
"esquema de cifrado específico pódense engadir \":port\" para indicalo. Por "
"exemplo: \"imap.foo.com:144\"."

